      "updated": 1781510832510,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mirrors the device's physical hierarchy:\n\nROOT   - device endpoint (OPC-UA server, S7 PLC)\nBRANCH - grouping (namespace/folder, program/FB)\nLEAF   - one value (node, variable, tag)\n\nBranches carry no value - only leaves do.\nEach leaf becomes one runtime data point.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "legend",
      "originalText": "Mirrors the device's physical hierarchy:\n\nROOT   - device endpoint (OPC-UA server, S7 PLC)\nBRANCH - grouping (namespace/folder, program/FB)\nLEAF   - one value (node, variable, tag)\n\nBranches carry no value - only leaves do.\nEach leaf becomes one runtime data point.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 125
    },
